# This repo tracks a curated subset of the project (see README):
# .py / .ipynb / Slurm .sh only, for the core package, simulation
# experiments 1-4, and the Section-6 lung atlas (K=13) real-data analysis.
# Everything else (raw data, results, logs, PDFs, other real-data
# analyses) is intentionally excluded below.

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Slurm logs (regenerated every run)
*/Error_Messages/*.err
*/Output_Messages/*.out
*.out
*.err

# Generated results (regenerated by re-running the pipeline) -- whole dirs,
# not just raw/*.csv, since combined CSVs/.tex/.pdf outputs and per-notebook
# subdirs (paper/, new_pooled/, stack_pool/, single_source/, combined_new_pooled/,
# etc.) land directly under these too.
/Results_simulation/
Final_Lung_Atlas_Analysis/results/
Final_Lung_Atlas_Analysis/results_0.5_alpha/
Final_Lung_Atlas_Analysis_PCA100/results_0.5_alpha/
Lung_Analysis_Sweep/results/
Lung_Analysis_Sweep/cache/
Final_Mouse_PBMC_Analysis/results/
Final_Mouse_PBMC_Analysis/data/

# Timestamped backups of results dirs, taken before a clear-and-resubmit
# (e.g. results_0.5_alpha_pre_expansion_backup_2026-08-17/) -- never meant
# for the repo, same as the results dirs they're backing up.
*_backup_*/

# Raw data (large binaries; obtain separately)
*.h5ad
*.npy

# Out-of-scope real-data analyses / dirs (not Section 6's lung atlas)
/Final_Lung_Atlas_Analysis_NKvT/
/Final_Lung_Atlas_Analysis_Coarse3/
/Final_Pancreas_Analysis/
/Final_FMRI_Analysis/
/Final_Metabolomics_Analysis/
/Pancreas_Data/
/FMRI_DATA/
/Metabolomics_Data/
/lung_atlas_analysis/
/intro_illustration/

# External raw data bundle (MoDaH paper's Zenodo archive, ~2.9GB, not ours
# to redistribute) -- Final_Mouse_PBMC_Analysis/preprocess.py reads from it
# locally but the repo doesn't ship it.
/MoDaH_Data/

# Reference/personal PDFs and notes kept local-only
*.pdf
session_notes_*.md
deploy_key.txt

# One-off local diagnostic script, not part of the curated package/analysis
# (compares a live run's raw CSVs against the pre-expansion backup above).
Final_Lung_Atlas_Analysis/verify_against_table1.py
